== Trivia ==
* 20/20 is an idiom that refers to someone with near-perfect vision.
* Despite only having one eye, {{C|Cain}} shoots two tears at once with this item.
* {{dlc+|r}} This item is used in {{chal|Seeing Double}}.{{dlc-}}

